.TH QUANUX-CLEARSTREET 7 "February 2026" "QuanuX 1.0" "QuanuX Extensions"
.SH NAME
quanux-clearstreet \- High-performance C++ Adapter for Clear Street API

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B quanuxctl run clear-street
.br
.B quanuxctl install clear-street
.br
.B quanuxctl integrate onixs --path <SDK_PATH>

.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBquanux-clearstreet\fR extension provides a dual-engine trading gateway to the Clear Street Execution API. 
It supports both the proprietary \fBOnixS\fR high-performance FIX engine (if injected) and the open-source \fBQuickFIX\fR engine as a fallback.

.SH FEATURES
.TP
.B Dual-Engine Architecture
Automatically detects the presence of the OnixS SDK. If found, it compiles with optimized thread-pinning and spin-lock support.
.TP
.B L3 Market Recorder
Captures high-fidelity Market-By-Order (L3) data directly to DuckDB Parquet files for analytical replay.
.TP
.B Pre-Trade Risk Layer
Enforces hard C++ limits on Order Quantity, Position Size, and Daily Loss before orders leave the process memory.
.TP
.B Dynamic Hot-Swap
Allows strategy logic (`.so` shared libraries) to be reloaded at runtime without disconnecting the FIX session.

.SH CONFIGURATION
Configuration is loaded from \fBlocal_config.json\fR in the extension directory.

.SS Risk Management
.TP
.B max_order_qty
Maximum quantity allowed per single order.
.TP
.B max_daily_loss
Cumulative PnL loss limit that triggers a trading halt.

.SS Recorder
.TP
.B mode
Recording depth: "L1" (Top), "L2" (Price), or "L3" (Order).
.TP
.B enabled
Set to \fBtrue\fR to archive data to DuckDB.

.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.TP
.B CLEARSTREET_USER
FIX Protocol Username (Tag 553).
.TP
.B CLEARSTREET_PASSWORD
FIX Protocol Password (Tag 96).
.TP
.B CLEARSTREET_SENDER_COMP_ID
SenderCompID (Tag 49).
.TP
.B CLEARSTREET_TARGET_COMP_ID
TargetCompID (Tag 56).

.SH EXAMPLES
.B Inject OnixS SDK:
.br
$ quanuxctl integrate onixs --path ~/Downloads/onixs-sdk-cpp

.B Rebuild Extension:
.br
$ quanuxctl install clear-street

.SH SEE ALSO
\fBquanuxctl\fR(1), \fBduckdb\fR(1)

